    "question": {
      ":question/id": "31ef9522-7716-5237-89f2-02ea3e1ed70c",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following matrices are upper triangular matrices?\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "The matrices $A$ and $B$ are upper triangular matrices since all the entries below the main diagonal are zeros.\n\nThe matrix $C$ is *not* an upper triangular matrix since it has a non-zero element below the main diagonal: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{c}_{21} & =-8\\ne 0\\end{aligned}\n$$",
